A command whose broken struct holds a type error and an unused field y, whose record
names the finding the kinds make about y. The record's mark withholds that finding,
which the type error skips anyway, so the record is neither in effect nor stale.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {
	var b broken
	_ = b
}

type broken struct {
	x undefinedType
	//deadset:ignore DS1003 -- kept for the loader
	y int
}
